msgstr ""
"``elgg_get_ordered_event_handlers()`` используйте "
"``elgg()->events->getOrderedHandlers()``"

#: ../../appendix/upgrade-notes/3.2-to-3.3.rst:85
msgid ""
"``elgg_get_ordered_hook_handlers()`` use "
