#: ../../appendix/upgrade-notes/3.x-to-4.0.rst:869
msgid ""
"``Elgg\\Router\\Middleware\\WalledGarden::isPublicPage()`` can no longer be "
"called statically"
msgstr ""
"``Elgg\\Router\\Middleware\\WalledGarden::isPublicPage()`` больше нельзя "
"вызывать статически"

#: ../../appendix/upgrade-notes/3.x-to-4.0.rst:870
msgid ""
"``Elgg\\Cli\\PluginsHelper::getDependents()`` is no longer publically "
"available"
msgstr "``Elgg\\Cli\\PluginsHelper::getDependents()`` больше не доступен публично"

#: ../../appendix/upgrade-notes/3.x-to-4.0.rst:871
msgid "``ElggPlugin::getLanguagesPath()`` is no longer publically available"
msgstr "``ElggPlugin::getLanguagesPath()`` больше не доступен публично"

#: ../../appendix/upgrade-notes/3.x-to-4.0.rst:872
msgid ""
"An ``\\ElggBatch`` no longer implements the interface ``Elgg\\BatchResult`` "
"but still has the same features"
msgstr ""
"``\\ElggBatch`` больше не реализует интерфейс ``Elgg\\BatchResult``, но "
"сохраняет те же функции"

#: ../../appendix/upgrade-notes/3.x-to-4.0.rst:873
msgid ""
"An ``\\ElggEntity`` no longer implements the interface ``Locatable`` but "
"still has the same features"
msgstr ""
"``\\ElggEntity`` больше не реализует интерфейс ``Locatable``, но сохраняет "
"те же функции"

#: ../../appendix/upgrade-notes/3.x-to-4.0.rst:874
msgid ""
"An ``\\Elgg\\Event`` no longer implements the interfaces "
"``\\Elgg\\ObjectEvent`` and ``\\Elgg\\UserEvent`` but still has the same "
"features"
msgstr ""
"``\\Elgg\\Event`` больше не реализует интерфейсы ``\\Elgg\\ObjectEvent`` и "
"``\\Elgg\\UserEvent``, но сохраняет те же функции"

#: ../../appendix/upgrade-notes/3.x-to-4.0.rst:875
msgid "The view ``output/icon`` no longer uses the ``convert`` view var"
msgstr "Вью ``output/icon`` больше не использует переменную ``convert``"

#: ../../appendix/upgrade-notes/3.x-to-4.0.rst:876
msgid ""
"``ElggData::save()`` now always returns a ``bool`` as documented. All "
"extending classes have been updated (eg. ``ElggEntity``, ``ElggMetadata``, "
"``ElggRelationship``, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"``ElggData::save()`` теперь всегда возвращает ``bool`` согласно "
"документации. Все наследующие классы обновлены (напр. ``ElggEntity``, "
"``ElggMetadata``, ``ElggRelationship`` и т.д.)"

#: ../../appendix/upgrade-notes/3.x-to-4.0.rst:877
msgid "``Elgg\\Email::getTo()`` now always returns an ``array``"
msgstr "``Elgg\\Email::getTo()`` теперь всегда возвращает ``array``"

#: ../../appendix/upgrade-notes/3.x-to-4.0.rst:878
msgid ""
"``ElggPlugin::activate()`` and ``ElggPlugin::deactivate()`` now can throw an"
" ``Elgg\\Exceptions\\PluginException`` with more details about the failure"
msgstr ""
