msgid "``elgg.push_to_object_array``"
msgstr "``elgg.push_to_object_array``"

#: ../../appendix/upgrade-notes/4.x-to-5.0.rst:99
msgid ""
"``elgg.register_hook_handler`` use the ``register`` function provide by the "
"``elgg\\hooks`` module"
msgstr ""
"``elgg.register_hook_handler`` используйте функцию ``register``, "
"предоставляемую модулем ``elgg\\hooks``"

#: ../../appendix/upgrade-notes/4.x-to-5.0.rst:100
